  "generated_text": "1. **Identify the given equation:**\n   \\[\n   z + z^{-1} = \\sqrt{3}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Square both sides:**\n   \\[\n   (z + z^{-1})^2 = (\\sqrt{3})^2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   z^2 + 2 + 1/z^2 = 3\n   \\]\n\n3. **Solve for $z^2 + 1/z^2$:**\n   \\[\n   z^2 + 1/z^2 = 3 - 2 = 1\n   \\]\n\n4. **Square the result again:**\n   \\[\n   (z^2 + 1/z^2)^2 = 1^2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   z^4 + 2 + 1/z^4 = 1\n   \\]\n\n5. **Solve for $z^4 + 1/z^4$:**\n   \\[\n   z^4 + 1/z^4 = 1 - 2 = -1\n   \\]\n\n6. **Conclude the solution with the final answer:**\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{-1}\n   \\]",
